WEBVTT
NOTE The Long Walk: audio description track (kind="descriptions").

d1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Flat, dry red earth under a pale, cloudy sky. One elephant walks into view from the left.

d2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
More elephants follow it, adults with small calves walking close at their sides.

d3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The herd fills the frame: dozens of elephants walk from left to right in a long, steady line.

d4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
A large adult with pale tusks passes close to the camera. The calves stay tucked between the adults.

d5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.500
The line thins into small family groups with gaps of open ground between them, until the last elephants walk on.
